\section{URL enumeration}{

The listing is the GraphQL \code{issueConnection(input, first, after)} cursor
connection (\verb{\{ totalCount, pageInfo\{hasNextPage,endCursor\}, edges\{node\} \}}),
paginated with \code{after: endCursor}. \code{processId} is single-valued per query,
so the handler loops the selected processes. Free-text \code{query} is forwarded
as the server-side \code{search} field; \code{date_range} as \code{fromDate} / \code{toDate}.
Each record's detail is fetched once via \code{singleIssue(input:{issueId})},
sidecar-first (a URL already on disk is read from JSON, never re-fetched).
The canonical \code{url} is \verb{https://www.skipulagsgatt.is/issues/<id>}.
