\section{Performance}{

Enumeration is a handful of cursor pages per process plus one \code{singleIssue}
call per record. IS requests are throttled to 5 requests per second by
default; override via \code{getOption("planscanR.is_throttle_rate")}
(requests/sec; falsy disables).
}

